# Real DESI LOA paths — TEMPLATE (committed)

This file is the **template** for `private/loa_paths.md`, which is the actual
configuration consumed by tooling. The real `loa_paths.md` is gitignored so
restricted DESI LOA paths never enter git history.

## To set up on a new machine

```bash
cp private/loa_paths.md.template private/loa_paths.md
$EDITOR private/loa_paths.md
```

Fill in the placeholders with the actual paths on this machine. Once filled,
`private/loa_paths.md` is gitignored automatically.

---

## LOA catalog files

Path to the directory containing `QSO_cat_loa_*.fits` and BAL catalog files.

```
LOA_CATALOG_DIR = <FILL_IN>
```

## LOA spectra healpix root

Path to the per-healpix DESI LOA spectra tree (`healpix/<survey>/<program>/...`).

```
LOA_HEALPIX_ROOT = <FILL_IN>
```

